# libgpio

libgpio can be used to ease the access of GPIOs on Linux systems using
the old deprecaded sysfs method.

Please consider using https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/libs/libgpiod/libgpiod.git

## build

    ./autogen.sh
    ./configure && make && make install

also debian packages can be built:

    ./autogen.sh
    dpkg-buildpackage
